===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*um-unah||go first}}. Equivalent to [[aphaeresis|apheresis]] of {{af|tl|um-|una}}. Alternatively, possibly from {{af|tl|ma-|una}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Adverb===
{{tl-adv|b=+}}

# [[for]] a [[while]]; [[for]] a [[moment]]; [[for]] the [[time]] [[being]]; a [[minute]] {{q|when the nature of the anticipated change is not expressed}}
#: {{ux|tl|Puwede bang tumayo ka '''muna'''?|Can you stand up '''for a while'''?}}
#: {{ux|tl|Teka '''muna'''.|Wait '''a minute'''.}}
# [[first]] {{q|when the nature of the anticipated change is expressed or clearly implied}}
#: {{ux|tl|Bago siya mag-aral ng leksiyon, nagbabasa '''muna''' siya ng diyaryo.|Before he studies his lessons, he reads newspapers '''first'''.}}
# [[yet]] {{q|used after [[negative]] [[imperative]]s and [[hortative]]s}}
#: {{ux|tl|Huwag ka '''muna'''ng kumain.|Don't eat '''yet'''.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Huwag '''muna''' tayong umalis.|Let's not leave '''yet'''.}}

